<title>USA: J.B. Hunt Transport Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>J.B. Hunt Transport Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LOWELL, Ark. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. B. Hunt Transport Services, Inc.</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended	    Year Ended</p>
<p>				   December 31		 December 31</p>
<p>				 1996	  1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Operating revenues   $  381,422  $  358,468  $1,486,748  $1,352,225</p>
<p>  Special charges		--	17,296	    --	17,296</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss):</p>
<p>Before special</p>
<p>   charges	     $    5,364  $    4,135  $   22,115  $    8,726</p>
<p>After special</p>
<p>   charges	     $    5,364  $   (6,761) $   22,115  $   (2,170)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss)</p>
<p>per share</p>
<p>Before special</p>
<p>   charges	     $	.14  $	.11  $	.58  $     .23</p>
<p>After special</p>
<p>   charges	     $	.14  $     (.18) $	.58  $    (.06)</p>
<p>Avg shrs		     37,427	38,289	37,913	38,520</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year includes gain from sale of special commodities and parcel management units. 1995 special charge related to exiting auto hauling business.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 fuel prices hurt earnings by $0.10 a share.</p>
